{
  "SM_006010_0000_NAR": "They had finally made it.\r\nAs promised, Lukaon, the boy from\r\nCereza's dreams, was waiting.\r\nBut unlike his radiant ethereal\r\ncounterpart, this Lukaon looked \r\npale and lifeless.",
  "BK_8200_0080_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]And you were right. I never would \r\nhave made it this far on my own.\r\nThank you.[FONT:N ]",
  "SM_006010_0250_LUC": "“With the seal broken\r\nand my faerie power restored,\r\nwe can leave this forest together!\r\nI will help you save your mother,\r\nso please...”",
  "PH_6010_0010_NAR": "Morgana had succeeded in breaking\r\nthe barrier trapping them in the forest.",
  "SM_006010_0190_NAR": "Unable to kill Lukaon,\r\nbut fearing the return of\r\nhis royal bloodline,\r\nthe rebellious faeries sealed\r\nhis body using a powerful spell.",
  "BK_6040_0010_NAR": "Staring down what must have been \r\nevery last faerie in Avalon,\r\nCereza's legs began to tremble.\r\nBut no matter the odds, \r\nshe refused to give up.",
  "BK_6020_0130_NAR": "But before Púca could finish,\r\nMorgana extinguished his life\r\nwith a single powerful strike.",
  "BK_6030_0090_LUC": "“Please, mother, no more.\r\nI can't bear to see you like this.”\r\n",
  "BK_6020_0020_CER": "“Cheshire!”",
  "BK_6020_0100_NAR": "This was a technique Cereza \r\nhad seen before.",
  "BK_6020_0090_NAR": "Something sent the faeries flying\r\nlike leaves scattered to the wind.",
  "CE_006805_0000_CER": "You can do it, Cheshire...\r\nDon't give up!",
  "BK_8200_0030_CER": "“Our...journey?”\r\n\r\n",
  "SM_006040_0120_MOR": "“Oh, I see. \r\nMade a new “friend” have you?”",
  "SM_006010_0120_CER": "“Human...and faerie?”",
  "BK_6040_0020_NAR": "But then-",
  "SM_006030_0170_POO": "“So be it.\r\nOne way or another he will die.\r\nAnd with his royal line extinguished\r\nwe shall be eclipsed no longer!”",
  "SM_006010_0360_CER": "“Sacrifice Cheshire? \r\nI can't do that, he's my friend!”\r\n",
  "CE_006060_0000_CER": "Not a chance!",
  "BK_6000_0040_CER": "“You really mean to sacrifice Cheshire?\r\nStop, I'm begging you!”",
  "BK_6100_0000_CER": "“Cheshire!”",
  "SM_006030_0060_NAR": "It was Púca, the self-proclaimed king.\r\nHis usual retinue was nowhere to be seen.\r\n\r\nThough his outfit had seen better days,\r\nhis elocution was still to be admired.",
  "LV_006020_0000_CER": "Keep at it Cheshire! Just a bit more!",
  "CE_006150_0000_CER": "Hnn...ahh!",
  "BK_6030_0000_CER": "“Morgana...\r\nI know I wasn't a good pupil.”",
  "BK_6000_0030_CER": "“Lukaon, what are you doing?”",
  "BK_6020_0210_CER": "“Morgana?”",
  "SM_006030_0130_CER": "“No, Lukaon, you can't!”",
  "SM_006030_0090_POO": "“And led by our faerie light,\r\none ill needs that lupine guide.\r\nLeave the filthy beast where he lies.”",
  "CE_006050_0000_CER": "Now it's our turn!",
  "SM_006020_0010_LUC": "“My soul cannot hold this form\r\nmuch longer...I figured this\r\ntime was my last chance.”",
  "SM_006010_0310_CER": "“What?”",
  "CE_006160_0000_CER": "Wahhh!",
  "LV_006010_0000_CER": "Here they come! Leave them to me!",
  "SM_006010_0050_LUC": "“No, I am here.\r\nI'm afraid what you see in that \r\ncrystal is nothing but a shell...”",
  "SM_006010_0280_CER": "“W-what?\r\nI...did?”",
  "SM_006010_0400_CER": "“I want to help you but\r\nI simply cannot do that.”",
  "BK_6020_0170_NAR": "Morgana said nothing.\r\nShe gently stroked the wolf's fur.",
  "SM_006020_0000_NAR": "The sorrow and anger were gone \r\nfrom Lukaon's eyes.",
  "SM_006010_0380_LUC": "“Look at it! Demons are Infernal \r\ncreatures that feast on human souls!\r\n\r\n\r\nYou witches harness their power\r\nas a tool, a weapon, nothing more!”",
  "CE_006820_0010_NAR": "[FONT:10 ]He's going to pay for that.\r\nTime to take back what he stole![FONT:N ]",
  "BK_6010_0010_CER": "“Lukaon!”",
  "SM_006040_0080_NAR": "Cereza had endured her share of\r\nscolding from Morgana, \r\nbut this time was different.\r\nThese were not the words of \r\na strict teacher. They were filled\r\nwith nothing but pure loathing.",
  "BK_8200_0070_CER": "“Cheshire...”",
  "SM_006010_0220_LUC": "“All I could do was wander the forest,\r\ntrying desperately to hold on to\r\nthe memory of my human self.\r\n\r\nBut Cereza, there exists one \r\nway to break this curse.”",
  "SM_006010_0430_CER": "“Lukaon...”",
  "CE_006090_0000_CER": "That all you've got!?",
  "BK_6040_0030_CER": "“Cheshire?”",
  "SM_006040_0050_NAR": "Thunder crashed in the distance.\r\nWind screamed through the trees.\r\nA cold chill ran through the air.",
  "BK_8200_0020_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]I see. Well then, I guess that means our journey is over, hmm?[FONT:N ]\r\nThe demon sounded disappointed.",
  "SM_006030_0140_LUC": "“This is for the best, Cereza.\r\nMy time is up...”",
  "CE_006810_0000_CER": "If we work together,\r\nno one can stop us!",
  "BK_6020_0120_POO": "“You loathsome witch! \r\nI should have known you-”",
  "BK_6020_0000_NAR": "Escaping the faeries' clutches,\r\nthe pair made it out of the forest.",
  "BK_6020_0110_CER": "“Morgana!”",
  "CE_006010_0000_CER": "Cheshire, faster!",
  "SM_006020_0050_CER": "“Lukaon...”",
  "CE_006120_0000_CER": "Morgana, you won't stop will you...",
  "SM_006010_0350_LUC": "“...What? What do you mean, why not?”",
  "SM_006010_0090_NAR": "And it was in that body that\r\nLukaon had guided them\r\nthrough the forest.",
  "BK_8200_0090_CER": "“Cheshire wait!\r\nI promised to send you home.\r\nI intend to keep that promise!”",
  "SM_006010_0010_CER": "“L-Lukaon?”",
  "IN_6000_0100_MOR": "That speed...I-impossible!\r\n",
  "SM_006030_0070_CER": "“We're in no mood for your riddles, \r\nback off!”\r\n",
  "BK_6000_0050_NAR": "Hearing desperation in Cereza's voice,\r\nfor an instant Lukaon hesitated...\r\nBut his mind was made up.",
  "SM_006010_0110_LUC": "“My blood. \r\nI am the child of human and faerie.”\r\n",
  "CE_005160_0000_CER": "“Cheshire, let's go!”",
  "SM_006010_0080_LUC": "“Don't be afraid...\r\nWhile my body was sealed,\r\nmy soul still runs free\r\nin the body of this wolf.”",
  "SM_006010_0260_CER": "“Something only a witch can possess?\r\nJust say the word; \r\nhow can I help?”",
  "BK_8210_0000_NAR": "Friends protect each other.",
  "CE_006000_0010_CER": "What're we going to do...?",
  "SM_006030_0040_CER": "“You!”",
  "BK_6020_0230_MOR": "“How dare you...\r\nHow dare you say those words\r\nafter what you did to him \r\nyou foolish girl!”",
  "BK_6000_0100_CER": "“I thought we could be friends!”\r\n",
  "BK_6030_0050_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]Pull yourself together.\r\nShe is our enemy![FONT:N ]\r\nCheshire tried to get \r\nCereza to her feet.",
  "SM_006030_0000_CER": "“Of course! \r\nIf we can get you to my master\r\nshe'll find a way to save you!”",
  "BK_6020_0200_NAR": "She saw an expression of which\r\nshe did not think Morgana was capable.\r\nIt was warm...filled with love.",
  "BK_6030_0060_NAR": "Morgana's next attack\r\nwould come at any moment.\r\nBut Cereza could not move a muscle.",
  "SM_006030_0110_NAR": "Hearing his words, Cereza knew:\r\nit had been Púca who had\r\nbetrayed the faerie king.\r\nPúca who had torn Lukaon's family apart\r\nbefore cursing him to wander\r\nthe forest in solitude.",
  "SM_006030_0030_POO": "“Splendid! \r\nOh, the pathos is palpable!”",
  "SM_006020_0020_CER": "“No...”",
  "BK_6020_0150_CER": "“This wolf, \r\nit's actually the spirit of a boy!",
  "BK_6020_0040_NAR": "Caught by the faeries,\r\nthey were slowly being \r\ndragged back into the forest.",
  "SM_006040_0010_NAR": "Morgana appeared to be growing\r\nmore angry by the second.\r\nShe advanced on Cereza and Cheshire.",
  "BK_8200_0060_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]I'm sorry for what I did\r\nback there in the forest.[FONT:N ]",
  "SM_006040_0090_CER": "“Morgana, I-I...”",
  "SM_006010_0170_NAR": "But a faction of evil faeries \r\nconspired against him.\r\nKilling the king in cold blood,\r\nthey next came for his wife\r\nand young Lukaon.",
  "BK_6010_0000_NAR": "Having lost Cheshire's power,\r\nLukaon struggled to stay on his feet.\r\nAnd then...",
  "SM_006040_0060_MOR": "“Dozens of girls I \r\nlured into that forest...\r\nEach required years of training. \r\nAll for naught!”",
  "CE_006820_0000_CER": "Cheshire!",
  "SM_006010_0140_NAR": "And so, the boy told Cereza\r\nof his tragic past.",
  "CE_006020_0000_CER": "Dodge that, Cheshire!",
  "BK_6020_0160_CER": "If we don't do something, \r\nhe'll die. Please Morgana, \r\ncan you save him?”",
  "CE_006110_0000_CER": "Back at you!",
  "BK_6000_0060_CER": "“Cheshire!”",
  "SM_006010_0030_LUC": "“Welcome Cereza,\r\nI knew you would make it.”",
  "BK_6030_0140_MOR": "“A pity. You had the potential \r\nto become a fine witch, Cereza,\r\nif only you'd hardened your heart...\r\nBut you were always so damn soft!”",
  "BK_6030_0020_CER": "“You might have been strict, but\r\nI always knew you cared about me.\r\nYou were...like a mother to me.”",
  "SM_006030_0150_CER": "“Lukaon, don't give up!”",
  "BK_6030_0130_NAR": "Her expression fixed,\r\nMorgana moved her son aside.",
  "CE_006815_0000_CER": "If I can destroy that...\r\nI might be able to free Cheshire!",
  "SM_006030_0160_CER": "“We're not going to let\r\nyou take him, got it?!\r\n\r\nAnd for the record,\r\nI knew you were lying about being a king!”",
  "BK_6030_0010_CER": "“I always messed up during training,\r\nand broke your rules.\r\nI-I know I let you down...”",
  "SM_006020_0040_LUC": "“Cheshire, was it?\r\nForgive me for what I tried to do.\r\nThe only heartless one...was me.”",
  "BK_6100_0010_CER": "",
  "SM_006010_0340_CER": "“Wha - I - I can't do that!”",
  "BK_8210_0030_CER": "“I am an Umbra Witch, \r\njust like my mum.”",
  "BK_8200_0085_NAR": "Cereza was moved by the\r\ndemon's unexpected words.",
  "BK_6040_0000_NAR": "On Púca's signal, a terrifying number \r\nof faeries appeared out of the darkness. ",
  "SM_006010_0180_NAR": "His mother managed to save\r\nLukaon's spirit, before she was\r\ndriven out of the faerie kingdom,\r\nnever to return again.",
  "SM_006010_0100_CER": "“You were sealed? But why?”",
  "PH_6010_0000_NAR": "All of a sudden, there was an ear-splitting crack,\r\nand a flash of light illuminated the sky.",
  "SM_006010_0240_LUC": "“Oh Cereza, \r\nI'm so happy you made it here safely.\r\nNow, I beg you, please help me \r\nwake from this nightmare.”\r\n\r\n",
  "BK_8200_0010_CER": "“What am I supposed to do!?\r\nThere's no way I can fight Morgana!”",
  "SM_006040_0100_MOR": "“Useless girl...\r\n\r\nLukaon and I will be together again.\r\nYou will surrender that\r\nwretched demon this instant!”",
  "CE_006070_0000_CER": "Go, Cheshire!",
  "SM_006010_0270_LUC": "“Why Cereza, you've already \r\nbrought me exactly what I need!”",
  "SM_006040_0130_MOR": "“A demon born under the\r\nfull moon of the bissextile night.\r\nThat creature is the key to\r\nbreaking Lukaon's curse!\r\nNow Cereza...I have waited far\r\ntoo long to let a child's\r\nsentiment stand in my way!”",
  "SM_006010_0020_NAR": "As Cereza called out his name,\r\nshe heard Lukaon's voice, \r\never so faint.",
  "CE_006140_0000_CER": "Goodbye, Morgana...",
  "BK_6030_0120_LUC": "“Mother...Mother!”",
  "SM_006040_0020_CER": "“Morgana, what are you saying?\r\nWhat's wrong?”",
  "BK_8200_0050_CER": "“What is it?”\r\n",
  "BK_6040_0040_NAR": "The writhing mass of faeries \r\nhot on his heels, Cheshire \r\nran towards the pillar of light.",
  "SM_006030_0010_LUC": "“What?”",
  "CE_006040_0000_CER": "Get down!",
  "SM_006010_0060_NAR": "Both Cereza and Cheshire were startled.\r\nThe source of Lukaon's voice\r\nwas none other than the white wolf.",
  "SM_006010_0230_LUC": "“It requires a special power,\r\nsomething only a witch can possess.\r\n\r\nAnd so, each time a witch entered \r\nthe forest my hopes soared!\r\nI tried my best to guide them here but...”",
  "SM_006020_0030_LUC": "“I thought demons were all\r\nheartless monsters...\r\nBut I was wrong.”",
  "BK_6030_0100_MOR": "“Don't fret, my dear.\r\nSoon everything will be back\r\nto the way it was.”",
  "BK_8210_0040_CER": "“Come on, let's dance!”",
  "SM_006010_0210_NAR": "Lukaon's past reminded \r\nCereza of her own.\r\nHer heart hurt for him.",
  "BK_6000_0010_CER": "“There must be something else.\r\nI'll help you find another way!”",
  "LV_006005_0000_NAR": "Cheshire ran like the wind. \r\nCereza felt his warmth through his mane.\r\nThere was no stopping them now.",
  "BK_6000_0090_NAR": "Cereza knew what she had to do.",
  "SM_006030_0080_POO": "“Why, we have no need to quarrel.\r\nOur subjects will gladly escort you\r\nto the edge of the forest.”",
  "CE_006080_0000_CER": "Too slow!",
  "BK_8210_0020_NAR": "Gone was the fear and hesitation\r\nfrom Cereza's eyes. In its place\r\nwas courage and steadfast resolve.",
  "_00": "",
  "SM_006030_0050_POO": "“On behalf of Avalon Forest,\r\nyou have our eternal gratitude,\r\nwhy, the trees themselves shall\r\nsing a ballad of your deeds.”",
  "CE_006800_0000_CER": "Lukaon! You can't have Cheshire!",
  "BK_6020_0220_MOR": "“You want to save him?”",
  "CE_006000_0000_CER": "We can't escape Morgana...",
  "BK_8210_0010_NAR": "Friends keep their promises.",
  "SM_006010_0130_LUC": "“Fear not.\r\n\r\nNot all faeries are like \r\nthose you've met. I wish to \r\nlive in harmony with humans.\r\n\r\nFor that, I was cursed to this fate.”",
  "CE_006130_0000_CER": "But I won't back down!",
  "BK_6000_0070_NAR": "Captured by the faerie prince,\r\nCheshire's life force \r\nwas being drained.",
  "BK_6020_0180_NAR": "Confused, \r\nCereza looked at her master.",
  "LV_006025_0000_CER": "Don't mess with a witch!",
  "BK_6020_0005_NAR": "Or so they thought...",
  "SM_006040_0030_MOR": "“You still don't get it?\r\nThe training, the brace...\r\nThe dream?”",
  "SM_006010_0370_LUC": "“Your friend? You mean that demon?\r\nCereza, what are you saying?”",
  "BK_8200_0000_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]What's wrong,\r\ngiving up without a fight?[FONT:N ]\r\n\r\nCereza heard Cheshire's voice\r\nringing clearly in her mind.",
  "SM_006040_0000_MOR": "“Cereza...why is that demon still here?\r\nDid you not reach the altar?\r\n\r\nWhat do you think those\r\nyears of training were for?”",
  "SM_006010_0160_NAR": "The king was loved by his subjects,\r\nand even sought a way to live\r\nin harmony with the human world.\r\n",
  "LV_006015_0000_CER": "Cheshire, be careful!",
  "SM_006040_0070_MOR": "“I was so close this time.\r\nBut you had to go and ruin \r\neverything, you selfish brat!”\r\n",
  "BK_6000_0020_LUC": "“You don't understand...\r\nThis is my last chance!”",
  "SM_006010_0330_LUC": "“Hurry, I must absorb that demon's power.\r\nAt long last...the curse will be broken!”",
  "SM_006010_0070_CER": "“Wh-why does the white wolf \r\nsound like Lukaon...?”\r\n",
  "BK_6020_0050_NAR": "Refusing to give in,\r\nCereza held on with all her might.\r\nBut then...",
  "CE_005140_0000_CER": "“Cheshire, I'm here now, it's okay.\r\nUnleash your real power!”",
  "BK_6020_0140_CER": "“Morgana!\r\n\r\nI'm so sorry for disobeying you.\r\nBut please, save the \r\nscolding for later.”",
  "SM_006030_0120_LUC": "“You fiend!\r\nEnough...I will run no longer.\r\nBut in exchange, let those two go.”",
  "SM_006040_0040_MOR": "“Do you have any idea how long\r\nI prepared for the day my \r\nprecious Lukaon would return!”",
  "CE_006820_0020_CER": "Okay, let's go!",
  "SM_006010_0300_LUC": "“That demon is perfect.\r\nJust what we need to break the curse!”",
  "SM_006010_0150_NAR": "Lukaon was the last faerie prince,\r\nthe son of the former king\r\nand his human queen.",
  "BK_6010_0020_NAR": "A heroic demon?\r\nSuch altruism was unheard of\r\nthroughout all Infernal texts...\r\nBut Cereza understood.",
  "SM_006010_0290_LUC": "“Yes! You brought the sacrifice!”\r\n",
  "SM_006010_0040_CER": "“Hold on, Lukaon,\r\nI'll get you out of there!”",
  "BK_8200_0040_NAR": "[FONT:9 ]That's what you'd call it, right,\r\nthis whole thing to save your mum?\r\nYou blabbered so much about her,\r\neven I was starting to look\r\nforward to meeting her...[FONT:N ]\r\nCheshire paused.",
  "SM_006010_0410_LUC": "“I don't believe this...”",
  "SM_006030_0020_CER": "“There's still time.\r\nCome on, we have to get you to her.\r\n\r\nLukaon, I won't let you die here!”",
  "BK_6030_0030_MOR": "“Get away!”",
  "SM_006030_0180_POO": "“Faerie brethren:\r\nthe cursed child is finally within our grasp.\r\nThe false king's sun reaches its nadir,\r\nand now Púca's star shines bright!”",
  "BK_6000_0080_CER": "“I can't believe I trusted you!”",
  "SM_006010_0390_CER": "“You're wrong. Cheshire is no tool. \r\nHe's a living creature, \r\nwith his own thoughts and dreams.\r\nWe made it this far by working together,\r\nso I'm not about to offer him\r\nup like some sacrificial goat!”",
  "BK_6010_0030_LUC": "“You two...”",
  "BK_6000_0000_NAR": "Cereza saw Lukaon's face,\r\nonly a moment ago so full of hope,\r\nnow contorted by sorrow.\r\nShe wanted desperately to help him.",
  "SM_006010_0200_CER": "“Both your parents...Lukaon, \r\nyou've been through so much.”",
  "SM_006010_0320_NAR": "Cereza could not believe her ears.\r\nSacrifice Cheshire?",
  "CE_006030_0000_CER": "Jump!",
  "SM_006030_0100_NAR": "Púca was after Lukaon's spirit,\r\nand the royal power that it contained.",
  "SM_006010_0420_LUC": "“I'm sorry Cereza,\r\nbut you leave me no choice.”",
  "BK_6030_0070_NAR": "Just then,\r\nsomething caused Morgana to stop.\r\nUsing the last of his strength,\r\nLukaon clung to her dress.",
  "CE_006100_0000_CER": "How about this?",
  "BK_6030_0021_CER": "“I just wanted to\r\nmake you proud!”"
}
